    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "Note",
      "pos": [
        -560,
        40
      ],
      "size": [
        500,
        360
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 12,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "text": ""
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "AFLOY LORA BOX - ADVANCED (Z-Image Turbo)\n=========================================\nPipeline: base -> hi-res (decode -> image upscale 1.5x -> encode -> 2nd KSampler\ndenoise 0.4) -> FaceDetailer\n-> PreviewImage. Great for character LoRAs (sharp faces in full-body shots).\n\n1) Models: z_image_turbo_bf16, qwen_3_4b (lumina2), ae.safetensors.\n2) In Lora Box: pick your LoRA(s) (rows start empty), type your prompt -> Queue.\n3) Tweak: ImageScaleBy 'scale_by' = upscale amount; 2nd KSampler 'denoise'\n   (~0.35-0.45) = how much the upscale re-renders; FaceDetailer 'denoise'\n   (~0.4) = face refine strength; 'bbox_threshold' = detection sensitivity.\n\nREQUIRES (besides core + Lora Box): ComfyUI-Impact-Pack (FaceDetailer +\nUltralyticsDetectorProvider + face_yolov8m bbox model) and rgthree-comfy\n(Image Comparer). The before/after slider + face-mask preview are optional - delete\nthem if you don't want those deps. For a zero-\ndependency version use Afloy-LoraBox-Z-Image.json instead."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653",
      "title": "READ ME - advanced"
    },
